WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:43.910
Where is he?

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:45.580
Where is he?

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.550
Where will he be coming from?!

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.920
Go! Rose Bits!

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.140
N-not again!
It's another dummy!

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.310
That's cheating...

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:17.280
...hiding in this fog and
setting up an ambush like that.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.280
What's the matter?
Is that it?

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.950
Battles are ruthless.

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:31.250
When there is a winner,
there must always be a loser.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:34.960
Farewell.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.980
I hate that sound.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:52.440
In search of a particular
Gundam Fighter...

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:55.400
Domon Kasshu has
come to foggy London.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:03:05.360
Neo England
John Bull Gundam

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.610
His opponent is none other than...

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.280
...Gentle Chapman...

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.160
...the most powerful Fighter...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.820
...with 3 championships in a row...

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:07.370
...in the John Bull Gundam.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.620
Will Domon be able to defeat him...

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:13.250
...and learn the whereabouts
of his brother, Kyoji...

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.960
...who descended to Earth
with the Devil Gundam?

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.420
And now!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.630
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:28.930
Powerful Enemy!
Chapman's Heroic Challenge

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.020
Three of a kind.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.560
- Again!
- Chapman wins again!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.440
You must be Chapman.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.530
I'm looking for this man.

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:47.450
Terribly sorry, but I'm in
the middle of a game.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.150
Please wait until I'm finished.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.960
In that case, how about I play you?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:58.840
But on one condition: Tell me
everything you know if I win.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.420
And should you happen to lose?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.220
A man tries not to think about
what might happen if he loses.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.720
Very well.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.110
Call!

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.060
I've got three Aces.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.450
Full house.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.790
Sorry to disappoint you.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.580
When there is a winner,
there must always be a loser.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.170
That's the reality of the
world of competition.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.830
Quite impressive.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:38.790
However...

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.150
This isn't like you.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.220
Cheating won't help you
in a Gundam Fight match!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.140
Let me through!

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.100
I said, let me through!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.890
D-Domon?

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.310
What?

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.360
You've got a sharp eye.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.030
What's your name?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.740
Domon Kasshu.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.620
I'm a Gundam Fighter and
I've come to defeat you.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:14.670
Actually, I'd rather prefer if we
could compete in our Gundams.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.370
Please make your stay
in this room tonight.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.430
What a surprise.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.520
I expected to be thrown
in jail or something.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.810
Make yourselves at home.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.400
Wow!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:47.360
Chapman's the one who won the
championship several times, right?

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.490
Yeah.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.700
Good grief...

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.960
How could you think of
picking a fight with him?

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:55.290
If you're going to act crazy,
do it in your cockpit.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:57.750
Yeah.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.290
Okay!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.000
Break your promise,
and I won't talk to you again.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:02.920
Who's there?!

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.670
Hey, it's...

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.150
...George de Sand from Neo France.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.180
It's been a long time.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:23.860
I regret meeting you in this
disgraceful condition.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:27.480
Surprising that a man of your skill
would get beaten this badly.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:31.490
But you knew that
Chapman of Neo England...

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.870
...is a veteran fighter with
countless matches under his belt.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.830
Yes.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.500
I was well aware of his
exceptional fighting abilities.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.420
He always fought fairly...

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:45.250
...and he expressed great dignity
throughout.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.920
He was always the ideal
that I aspired to as a knight.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.070
But he's not the same man.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.550
I do believe Chapman has
transformed into something evil.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.060
What do you mean?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.100
D-during that duel...

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:04.810
...he broke International Regulations
requiring one-on-one matches.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.520
He used dummies to corner me...

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.240
...and he waited until
I was too tired to attack.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.160
That's how he came after me.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.160
No way.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:21.500
Chapman's not the kind of Fighter
who'd stoop to using dirty tricks!

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:24.230
It would seem his glory days
are in the past.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.380
The Chapman of today
is a bloodthirsty beast...

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:30.880
...who'll use whatever means
to run down his prey!

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.630
A bloodthirsty beast...

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.810
There's one more thing
I should mention.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.980
Though he fired at close range...

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.350
...the shot only grazed my cheek.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.570
Seemingly suffering great pain...

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.240
...he then disappeared into the fog.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:57.450
I would say that...
I would say that Chapman is...

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.660
Hey, come on!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.580
What about Chapman?!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.990
Stop! He needs to rest.

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:27.440
You've been taking
far too many, dear.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.860
You should stop taking these
altogether.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.070
Now, don't you worry.
I'm just fine.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.620
When the Tournament is all over,
let's go to Mars.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.530
I hear it's warmer there now...

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:42.110
...and has more comfortable living
conditions than we have here.

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.430
Good idea.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.580
About that boy...

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.500
That Fighter from Neo Japan?

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.840
Yes.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.300
Why don't we invite him
over for tea?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.470
Growing fond of him?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.570
He's just like you.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.280
Especially that sharp,
intense look of your eyes.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:04.890
Do as you wish.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.510
I've noticed that you like him, too.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.230
Who knows?

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.510
In any case, it's a mere boy
who's piloting a Gundam.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.720
We live in interesting times.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.290
Are we really going?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.620
We've been invited.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:29.330
It's only polite that we accept.

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.670
It could be a trap.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.630
All the better, then.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:36.170
I also want to check if all those
things George was saying are true.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.630
What in the world is that?

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.160
Smells nice.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.650
What's wrong?
Don't want it?

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.820
It's from Wales.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:00.410
Perhaps I should have
served green tea instead.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.910
I'm sorry, but I'm not used to
being treated so graciously.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.870
You needn't worry.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.000
There's no poison in that tea.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.250
I didn't come here to drink tea!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.750
I just want you to fight me!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.760
A fight?

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.760
Everyone I meet wants to
fight, fight, fight...

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.260
What's so funny?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.350
Being young is a wondrous thing.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:29.560
With belief in one's potential,
one can run to it at full speed.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.560
But, lad...

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.950
...that's a case of
overconfidence.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.650
When you realize someone
stronger than you...

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.410
...will always be there,
it's too late.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:40.650
What?

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:42.280
Uh, excuse me.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.240
I'd like to powder my...

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.540
Uh, I'm sorry.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.790
Are you all right?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.170
Uh, yes.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.130
Straight to the end,
then to your left.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.300
Thank you.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.180
Do you want a match that terribly?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.660
For what reason?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.270
You want to defeat me and
become some new hero?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.230
Do you actually think
you can defeat me?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.740
I captured the championship
three times in a row!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:25.970
Maybe not, when you were
a strong man with great pride.

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:28.660
But you're different now.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.660
Against a man who's only
clinging onto his past...

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:32.750
...I will surely not lose.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.210
What...?!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.710
I told you before!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.670
I'm a Gundam Fighter
who's here to defeat you.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.980
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:58.340
Just as I thought,
a mental stimulant.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.250
Unmanned mobile suits?

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:22.260
What George was saying is true.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.680
Is it clear?

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.310
The difference between us?

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:37.520
I am able to put an end to your life
while I hold this gun in my hand.

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:40.150
I told you before.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:43.240
A man tries not to think about
what might happen if he loses.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.240
Your life isn't a game.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.910
I-is the medicine
wearing off already?

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:58.380
Darling!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.630
You know...

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:03.510
...at your age, you have
so many other choices...

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:06.090
...other than to take part in the Fight.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:07.860
Manon...

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.100
Yes, darling.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.020
Very well.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.770
I accept your challenge...

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.030
...for a Gundam Fight match!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.990
Glad to hear it!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.410
Then come with me,
Domon Kasshu!

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.370
Gundam!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.830
Well, lad!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:16.120
I'll be sure to show you
all there is to know about fighting!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.620
Here I go, former Champion!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.330
Gundam Fight!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.460
Ready go!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.350
I see you're up.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.540
I am sorry.
I didn't want you hurt.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.480
But I had very little choice.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.270
As a woman, that is.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.870
What's the matter, Chapman?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.080
Quite good, lad!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.830
Launch mobile suit team!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.830
Activate fog smokescreen!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.800
What?

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.600
Wh-what's with this fog?

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:21.100
Damn, and it's not only
my main camera.

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:24.310
It looks like my radar
and infrared monitor...

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.110
...are completely scrambled, too.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.990
Manon! How can you...?!

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.700
Please listen to me.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:38.950
He has suffered physically from
numerous Fights over the years.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.290
But...

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:44.570
...he cannot rid himself of the
gunpowder soaked into his body!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.770
That's why...

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.300
...right up to his final moment...

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.450
...that man wishes to engage
in Gundam Fight matches.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:58.020
The medicine is for that reason.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:07.360
Your inexperience shows. Lost
because your eyesight's gone.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:11.150
You couldn't catch my shadow,
no matter how hard you tried.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:12.860
Calm down, Domon.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.660
He's in the same boat, too.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.290
There you are!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.590
What?!
It's not the John Bull Gundam!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:44.940
You're pathetic!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.650
Using this fog!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.900
You force me to fight
an entire army!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.030
You've sunk real low, Chapman!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.700
If you're a man,
fight me fair and square!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:06.210
Are you trying to lecture me
with that attitude?

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:11.670
I didn't return to the Gundam Fight
matches just for show!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:22.890
How can he see?

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:26.770
Chapman and I are both fighting
under the same conditions!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.730
It's true. Men are selfish.

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.030
They'll risk their lives
any time they wish...

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:35.950
...and find it beautiful to
throw it away without regrets.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.910
But, you see...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.120
...I made my decision.

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.250
To support that man however he
chooses to live his life.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.200
Manon...

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.420
His shots are
incredibly accurate.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.700
Am I finally seeing
Chapman's true abilities?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.010
Another one still!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.360
It's George!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.610
Chapman is using a type of
mental stimulant.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.240
That's how he can pinpoint his
opponent's position in this fog.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:18.400
No way.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.950
He's taking stimulants?!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:23.410
Leave these pests to me, and hurry
up and put a stop to Chapman!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.790
Unless he's looked after,
the side effects could destroy him!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:27.870
Okay!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.800
Come out, Chapman!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.010
I'm not running
from you anymore!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.260
Battles are ruthless.

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:44.350
Only the strong survive...

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.640
...leaving those weak ones
stuck in the mud!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:49.810
I'm not done!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:57.030
The people want a hero
who's invincible.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:01.240
I must always remain
a hero in their eyes.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.740
That's no reason...

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:06.620
That's no reason why
he had to take it this far!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:07.950
Enhancing his body
with stimulants...

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:12.130
...using reinforcement mobile suits,
and hiding behind a fake fog?!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.960
Chapman knows
nothing about this.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:22.260
I want that man to remain as
Champion, until the very end.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.510
Manon...

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:36.320
As a warrior becomes
even stronger...

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.490
...the less he is able to
escape this road of carnage.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:43.850
Damn!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.950
It's over if your head
gets blown off, right?

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:51.500
So, this is your last chance!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.500
Now is the time to quit,
Domon Kasshu!

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:05.640
M-my medicine...

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:07.140
M-my medicine...

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:08.850
Chapman...

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.390
Y-you fool!

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:16.310
My lad, what are you waiting for?!

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:17.480
But...!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:22.820
And that's where...
That's where you're too soft...

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:25.680
Shoot... Shoot...!

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:30.790
Go on. If you're a true warrior,
you wouldn't hesitate to shoot!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.790
You've also got a purpose
for fighting, don't you?!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.790
Go on! Shoot!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:56.100
W-well done.
That's well done.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:11.950
Darling...!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:16.710
It seems that times are
clearly changing.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.080
I'm sorry.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.210
I don't think I can keep my
promise about going to Mars.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.760
It's all right.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.550
As long as you're satisfied
by the way you fought.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:28.850
Without your support...

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.390
...it wouldn't have gone this well.

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:39.360
Thank you, Manon.

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:51.530
There's nothing to apologize for.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:54.290
I knew that this time would come.

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:56.240
I knew it when I first met him.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:58.290
That's right.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:59.590
Take a good look.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:02.960
This could happen to
all of you some day.

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:07.350
The fate of a warrior.

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:12.940
However, it's also within
your power to avoid this fate.

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:37.370
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:41.830
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:45.380
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:52.550
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:58.270
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.480 --> 00:23:03.520
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:10.070
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:14.200
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:20.210
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:34.510
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:37.770
Domon and Sai Saici
arrive in Neo Egypt...

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:40.890
...where they discover
a horrifying mummy...

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:44.230
...that attacks them mercilessly,
in ancient Gundam.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:49.650
And Domon finally gets a lead
on the Devil Gundam.

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:52.910
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:56.300
Terror of the Phantom Fighter!

00:23:54.620 --> 00:24:01.540
Terror of the Phantom Fighter!

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:59.270
Ready! Go!
